      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s okay here, although it would be nicer defined in a common location that could be used throughout the codebase. For example, this is already defined as `SEC_UL` in [timer.h](http://cs/chromeos_public/src/platform/ec/include/timer.h?rcl\u003de1cfeb867cc7c8a853198ceff80c375051598f60\u0026l\u003d24), but including `timer.h` here would make an odd dependency. If both files referenced common `constants.h` file it would make more sense.\n\nI don\u0027t think this is required for this CL though.",
