      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T17:58:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had to change this to fix the following error in the `bloonchipper` build:\n\n```\ncommon/timer.c:177:5: error: conflicting types for \u0027usleep\u0027\nint usleep(unsigned us)\n    ^\n/usr/armv7m-cros-eabi/include/sys/unistd.h:240:6: note: previous declaration is here\nint     usleep (useconds_t __useconds);\n        ^\n1 error generated.\n```\n\nDo you think it\u0027s okay to use this type?\n\nFYI, I tried also using `uint32_t` but it didn\u0027t work.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 178,
