      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T19:17:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Technically speaking it is more correct to use `__useconds_t` for [usleep](https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man3/usleep.3.html) so I think it would make sense to just add a typedef for `__useconds_t` to `builtins/sys/types.h` (if you map it to `unsigned` then it shouldn\u0027t change any behavior).",
